segment.source:
::He pauses, staring at you with that determination from before.::

I will let you speak. But if you move anything but your mouth you will die.

::He lets you breathe again.::&lt;end&gt;

::He is stone-faced, yet the havoc within him seeps through in the form of muscle contractions and clenching fists.

He addresses you with surprising self-control.::

What happened?&lt;end&gt;

